[{:db/id "q-120871/selection/211d25482485086f0cd423a1653b5c770b6e884977677d6eb29ada42fb2f1bca" :answer/id #uuid "b7921985-5e30-56c0-82bd-d7e5af928e64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-3}^{1}(-{x}^{2}-2x+3)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120871/selection/3376446569c168ec4716bca7de834e454d02378eb4dff9448298a1c49905d75b" :answer/id #uuid "c4f84890-1d1f-5f74-a8f9-80c770005867" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-3}^{1}({x}^{2}+x+3)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120871/selection/1e5d144be0ae92c9d8c7ddf888d53f0c3e2068487e9bcc1205ddb23072759e84" :answer/id #uuid "1dfd2477-7fa0-58bf-af28-2b8481fa73bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1}^{3}(-{x}^{2}-2x-1)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120871/selection/1051a11eb34f7c1c288e9941139225f9ddc7b786154f96fcff7728643c12989e" :answer/id #uuid "149ea9a1-7db3-5b03-a2d2-ec226205574b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1}^{2}(-{x}^{2}+3)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120871/selection/8c9d9c13a35d8af66bf43cfa1c11e1204c1e2472c0a601807bd8c013c1500bf9" :answer/id #uuid "c374d4f8-6c79-568e-992d-9d1c0a03e868" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-3}^{1}({x}^{2}-3x)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120871/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4fb38d7d-3f02-5a95-9252-236f17f95c63" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-120871/selection/211d25482485086f0cd423a1653b5c770b6e884977677d6eb29ada42fb2f1bca" :answer-field/choices ["q-120871/selection/211d25482485086f0cd423a1653b5c770b6e884977677d6eb29ada42fb2f1bca" "q-120871/selection/3376446569c168ec4716bca7de834e454d02378eb4dff9448298a1c49905d75b" "q-120871/selection/1e5d144be0ae92c9d8c7ddf888d53f0c3e2068487e9bcc1205ddb23072759e84" "q-120871/selection/1051a11eb34f7c1c288e9941139225f9ddc7b786154f96fcff7728643c12989e" "q-120871/selection/8c9d9c13a35d8af66bf43cfa1c11e1204c1e2472c0a601807bd8c013c1500bf9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-120871" :question/id #uuid "6c05958a-e92d-52eb-a776-84210c48e5f3" :question/math-academy-id "q-120871" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013841/assets/0ac836789132a294051f6cbd0756f26407d002fa83a278b3b8825cfdd9af0b81.png)\n\nWhich integral gives the area of the finite region bounded by $y={x}^{2}+3x-2$ and $y=x+1,$ shown above?" :question/worked-solution "The diagram shows that the intersection points between the two graphs occur when $x=-3$ and $x=1.$ So these will be our limits of integration.\n\nTo determine which is the lower function and which is the upper, let's draw our vertical arrow.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013841/assets/299608a54c0b5f568f32619722dd678af1388065f017620071ffb0473a686fa3.png)\n\nThe vertical line \n\n- *enters* the region through the lower function $y={x}^{2}+3x-2,$ and\n\n- *leaves* through the upper function $y=x+1.$\n\nTherefore, the integral that gives our area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-3}^{1}[\\,(\\text{upper function})-(\\text{lower function})\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3}^{1}[\\,(x+1)-({x}^{2}+3x-2)\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3}^{1}(-{x}^{2}-2x+3)\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-120871/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee633017-5c17-575f-bdab-5f12b7319355"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-120871"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424/selection/2ca62f906d72356d69d3e4a15e5e503c30ab8b9794054743b427f5425d0f386b" :answer/id #uuid "0378c0f2-21d1-51ed-aaf0-ebd978ab2497" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1/3}^{3/4}(-{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424/selection/1ae485130834cf3e603b1eaffadfd6a22338548aec888823e406d5dd1e63e045" :answer/id #uuid "1a332f33-85b0-5324-8301-b44ff93699c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}+x+5)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424/selection/0769ab92f08db86feb9b53d6a6931f9d1f5299a0681d343852892abc06b241b5" :answer/id #uuid "c11c3bf8-312f-5a70-9233-c53d2aa0cf46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1/4}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+1)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424/selection/5e29a46dff9a7e6fcbd12027e5f1c1f589b97de1650ef21b3dc27ba2bc77f792" :answer/id #uuid "25877345-fe31-505f-9cb2-97dd7779a860" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(8{x}^{2}-x-4)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424/selection/e5a2851211f542fd9cfcf106c2f7275665ee6e84243495971caacd862330bd9f" :answer/id #uuid "b30f0b69-53ad-5c42-bc9b-a047fcdeaf31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "35da2a72-17f3-52f4-9887-3a1a23d8be77" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-121424/selection/e5a2851211f542fd9cfcf106c2f7275665ee6e84243495971caacd862330bd9f" :answer-field/choices ["q-121424/selection/2ca62f906d72356d69d3e4a15e5e503c30ab8b9794054743b427f5425d0f386b" "q-121424/selection/1ae485130834cf3e603b1eaffadfd6a22338548aec888823e406d5dd1e63e045" "q-121424/selection/0769ab92f08db86feb9b53d6a6931f9d1f5299a0681d343852892abc06b241b5" "q-121424/selection/5e29a46dff9a7e6fcbd12027e5f1c1f589b97de1650ef21b3dc27ba2bc77f792" "q-121424/selection/e5a2851211f542fd9cfcf106c2f7275665ee6e84243495971caacd862330bd9f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-121424" :question/id #uuid "8b0cb8d7-3e11-5e09-bfb8-3963a1210c8e" :question/math-academy-id "q-121424" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013841/assets/a928b14cfe88f9aaf7b8cf5288a18f3e81e163ea65fd3a48653fcba630c11386.png)\n\nWhich integral gives the area of the finite region bounded by $y=8{x}^{2}-5$ and $y=1-2x,$ shown above?\n\n*(Note: Figure not drawn to scale)*" :question/worked-solution "The diagram shows that the intersection points between the two graphs occur when $x=-1$ and $x=\\frac{3}{4}.$ So these will be our limits of integration.\n\nTo determine which is the lower function and which is the upper, let's draw our vertical arrow.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013841/assets/226ade4a3b546484ba2e9ce5f266391fb51e9fe4b62e2e78d12200ac54ecea9a.png)\n\nThe vertical line \n\n- *enters* the region through the lower function $y=8{x}^{2}-5,$ and\n\n- *leaves* through the upper function $y=1-2x.$\n\nTherefore, the integral that gives our area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}[\\,(\\text{upper function})-(\\text{lower function})\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}[\\,(1-2x)-(8{x}^{2}-5)\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-121424/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee633017-5c17-575f-bdab-5f12b7319355"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-121424"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-80186/selection/98a0cfe8ccf5223db22f38e083822fe01917eeba317293f095ba583c13791d95" :answer/id #uuid "d385054a-cc01-50f3-af7b-5b1ce418da9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-2}^{2}({x}^{2}+2x+2)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80186/selection/cd1a6e42c8b082369d6d677286761c015037d0bae9b679cd5246688216d2a9af" :answer/id #uuid "614040ab-a878-52cf-a7c5-d5da620f21c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-1}^{2}({x}^{2}-x-2)\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/v